functions/
# Ignore tools/ contents via tools/* (NOT tools/) so git still descends into tools/
# and the negations below can re-include the App Store screenshot captures. A blanket
# tools/ excludes the dir itself, blocking any re-include of paths beneath it.
tools/*
# Re-include the App Store screenshot tool's captures (referenced .png only) so the
# ASO slide set is reproducible from the repo. Intermediate dirs must be re-included
# first (git won't descend into an excluded parent), then everything re-ignored,
# then the .png captures un-ignored. node_modules/dist/*.jpeg stay ignored.
!tools/appstore-screenshots/
tools/appstore-screenshots/*
!tools/appstore-screenshots/captures/
tools/appstore-screenshots/captures/*
!tools/appstore-screenshots/captures/*.png

nul
